      en: ["Founded in 1882 as the capital of the Republic of Stellaland", "Known as the 'Texas of South Africa' for its cattle industry", "One of the largest cattle auction centers in the Southern Hemisphere", "Major producer of maize, peanuts, and sunflower seeds", "Positioned on the strategic rail link to Zimbabwe", "Seat of the Dr. Ruth Segomotsi Mompati District Municipality"],
